sequenceDiagram
    participant Kubelet
    participant Probe as polar-healthcheck
    participant File as liveness file
    participant Health as HealthCheckActor
    participant Infra as InfrastructureSupervisor

    autonumber
    Note over Health: Normal phase, tick every 30s
    loop every tick, in every phase
        Health->>Health: evaluate Cassini, graph, certs
        Health->>File: write status, timestamp, phase
    end

    loop every 30s after 150s initial delay
        Kubelet->>Probe: exec
        Probe->>File: read
        Note over Probe: freshness only:<br/>file parses and is younger than 90s
        Probe-->>Kubelet: exit 0
    end

    Note over Health: own cert TTL below 300s
    Health->>Health: phase = WaitingForDeps
    Health->>File: write (WaitingForDeps)
    Note over Health: dependency certs healthy
    Health->>Health: phase = Jittering, random delay in 180s window
    Health->>File: write (Jittering), file stays fresh
    Health->>Infra: HealthVerdict::Rejuvenate
    Note over Infra: begin_shutdown, see shutdown_pipeline
    loop every tick during the drain
        Health->>File: write (shutting_down), probe keeps passing
    end

    alt hard deadline
        Note over Health: own cert below 60s, graph or Cassini deadline
        Health->>Infra: HealthVerdict::Unhealthy(reason)
        Note over Infra: begin_shutdown, same orderly path
    end

    alt process wedged
        Note over Health,File: nothing in-process runs, file goes stale
        Kubelet->>Probe: exec
        Probe->>File: read
        Probe-->>Kubelet: exit 1 (stale)
        Note over Kubelet: after 2 failures: SIGTERM,<br/>then SIGKILL after the grace period
    end
